        (*parser.Part)({
          Name: (string) "",
          Type: (string) (len=9) "paragraph",
          Value: (string) (len=817) "With over 100 million certified records sold worldwide, Shakira is one of the world's best-selling musicians. In 2022, MTV included her in the list of \"The Most Influential Women in the History of Music\", being the only Latina on the list. Billboard named her the Top Female Latin Artist of the Decade twice (2000s and 2010s), and ranked her among the Greatest Pop Stars of the 21st Century in 2024. For her philanthropic work with her Barefoot Foundation and her contributions to music, she received the Latin Recording Academy Person of the Year and Harvard Foundation Artist of the Year awards in 2011. Shakira was appointed to the President's Advisory Commission on Educational Excellence for Hispanics in the United States in 2011, and Chevalier of the Order of Arts and Letters by the French government in 2012.",
