              Name: (string) "",
              Type: (string) (len=9) "paragraph",
              Value: (string) (len=733) "Shakira's new album, titled Laundry Service in English-speaking countries and Servicio de Lavanderia in Latin America and Spain, was released on 13 November 2001. Servicio de Lavanderia features the same thirteen songs, arranged in different order. The album debuted at number three on the U.S. Billboard 200 chart, selling over 200,000 records in its first week. It was certified triple platinum by the RIAA in June 2004. It had established, for the most part, Shakira's musical presence in the mainstream North American market. Several album songs were issued also as singles: \"Whenever, Wherever\", \" Underneath Your Clothes \", \" Objection (Tango) \", \" The One \", \" Te Dejo Madrid \", \" Que Me Quedes Tú \", and \" Poem to a Horse \".",
